 - `summary`: a single line of at most 120 characters, shown in the agents' ticket list
 - `respond_within_hours`: 72, 24, 8 or 1, depending on the urgency
 
+Before the model sees the body, quoted reply text (`>` lines, "... wrote:" lines and everything after an "Original Message" marker) is removed. If the remaining body is over 4000 characters, its start and end are kept and the middle is left out.
